{"defaultLocale":"zh-CN","id":"Mouseww.Prometheus","installers":[{"architecture":"x64","dependencies":[],"id":"x64-user-nullsoft","installationMetadata":{"DefaultInstallLocation":"%LocalAppData%\\Prometheus"},"priority":1,"scope":"user","sha256":"f460b7c28aee848c64799e34de5732dc88021bee9a29aa70dca3afa4a9faea23","successCodes":[],"type":"nullsoft","uninstall":{"type":"registryKey","value":"Prometheus"},"url":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus/releases/download/v0.30.0/Prometheus_0.30.0_x64-setup.exe"},{"appsAndFeaturesEntries":[{"UpgradeCode":"{585FD20A-B31F-5AE5-AA54-FF9804385120}"}],"architecture":"x64","dependencies":[],"elevation":{"requirement":"elevationRequired","source":"inferred"},"id":"x64-machine-wix","installationMetadata":{"DefaultInstallLocation":"%ProgramFiles%\\Prometheus"},"installerSwitches":{"InstallLocation":"INSTALLDIR=\"<INSTALLPATH>\""},"priority":2,"scope":"machine","sha256":"39ea1100358a1362e7daacf7d602feabaf3e01e138805ee35c49b0da8d1d19b2","silent":{"arguments":"/quiet /norestart","source":"default"},"successCodes":[],"type":"wix","uninstall":{"type":"productCode","value":"{15D497ED-DA82-4AC4-95AB-39DF420C697D}"},"url":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus/releases/download/v0.30.0/Prometheus_0.30.0_x64_en-US.msi"}],"licenseUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","packageLocalizations":{"en-US":{"description":"An open-source, fork-friendly AI agent workbench.","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"Running and deploying","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus/blob/HEAD/docs/en/deployment.md"},{"DocumentLabel":"Prometheus Architecture","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus/blob/HEAD/docs/en/architecture.md"}],"license":"Freeware","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"An open-source, fork-friendly AI agent workbench: one kernel, four entry points — terminal / desktop / web / Android.\nTUI, desktop GUI (Tauri), web and Android share the same server and the same wire protocol, so a session continues anywhere. Gateways, knowledge bases, tools, commands, HTTP routes and UI panels are all contributed through definePlugin — even the built-in features are plugins.","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","chatbot","code","coding","large-language-model","llm","programming"]},"zh-CN":{"author":"Mouseww","copyright":"Copyright (c) 2026 Mouseww","description":"源码公开、可二次开发的 AI Agent 工作台：终端 / 桌面 / Web / 安卓四种入口。","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"运行与部署","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus/blob/HEAD/docs/deployment.md"},{"DocumentLabel":"Prometheus 架构设计","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus/blob/HEAD/docs/architecture.md"}],"license":"免费软件","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Prometheus 是一个源码公开、可二次开发的 AI Agent 工作台：同一个内核，终端 / 桌面 / Web / 安卓四种入口。\nTUI、桌面 GUI（Tauri）、Web、安卓共用同一套服务端与协议，会话随处可续。网关、知识库、工具、命令、HTTP 路由、UI 面板全部通过 definePlugin 贡献，连内置功能也是插件。","name":"Prometheus","packageUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus","publisher":"prometheus","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww","releaseNotes":"新功能\n- 独立工作树模式：每个对话可以在自己的 git 工作树里改代码，你点「合并」之前，项目文件夹一个字节都不会变。同一个项目里可以同时开多个对话，互不干扰\n  - 设置 → 独立工作树：关闭 / 每次询问 / 总是开启；可按项目单独覆盖；默认合并方式（压缩为一个提交 / 保留历史 / 只应用不提交）\n  - 新对话页的开关（模式为「每次询问」时出现）；对话里的面板显示分支、改动文件、领先/落后提交，可审查 diff、同步基础分支、合并或丢弃\n  - 合并前预检：项目文件夹是否仍在原分支、是否有同文件的未提交改动、对话是否仍在运行；冲突留在工作树里解决，项目文件夹不会出现冲突标记\n  - 提示与另一个对话改了相同文件；工作树对话不能直接写项目文件夹的绝对路径\n说明\n- 只对 git 仓库生效，其他文件夹照常直接修改；关闭后新对话与以前完全一样，已有对话不受影响\n- 隔离是路径级的，不是沙箱：agent 在 bash 里主动操作别的路径无法拦住\n- .prometheus/worktree.json 目前只支持 link / copy；自动化任务不走隔离\n- 设计说明见 docs/worktree-mode.md","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus/releases/tag/v0.30.0","tags":["人工智能","代码","大模型","大语言模型","智能体","编程","聊天机器人","自主智能"]}},"publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww/Prometheus/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/Mouseww","releaseDate":"2026-11-06","releaseDateSo